<para>The step reads any fields it needs from <computeroutput>ctx</computeroutput> and appends results to the appropriate collections (e.g. <computeroutput>ctx.entities</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>ctx.chunks</computeroutput>). It must not clear or overwrite data written by preceding steps.</para>
